        "question": "What is a carbon footprint?",
        "answer": "A carbon footprint is a quantitative assessment of an organization's greenhouse gas emissions."
      },
      "howToUse": {
        "question": "How to use CarboScan?",
        "answer": "CarboScan guides you step by step in calculating your carbon footprint through an intuitive questionnaire."
